  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>N</mi></math> be the set of natural numbers and two functions <math><mi>f</mi></math> and <math><mi>g</mi></math> be defined as <math><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>N</mi></math> such that<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><br />and <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Then <math><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></math> is:",
